{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>A zonah.</b> In all of Scripture we do not find on the level of peshat, zonah except in its plain sense; likewise 'they gave the child to a zonah' (as I explained there)." "<b>And a halalah.</b> Who is not publicly known like a zonah. And according to peshat it would appear from the words of Ezekiel that widows of a priest are permitted to priests; therefore the received tradition is the correct one."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:31.004499001Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}